* ADR1399H precision reference buffered by LTC6078
VINPUT IN 0 15

* ADR1399H shunt-reference bias and heater connections
RBIAS IN REF 1k
XREF REF 0 IN 0 ADR1399H

* Floating 5 V supply centered around the 7.05 V reference level
EVPLUS VPLUS 0 VALUE={V(IN)-5.5}
EVMINUS VMINUS 0 VALUE={V(IN)-10.5}

* Mid-supply bias for unused LTC6078 channel
RMID1 VPLUS VMID 100k
RMID2 VMID VMINUS 100k

* LTC6078 dual op amp: channel A is the VREF buffer
XU1 OUT OUT REF VMINUS VMID UNUSED UNUSED VPLUS LTC6078

* Required 1 k load
RLOAD OUT 0 1k

.tran 0 20m 0 10u
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 15m TO 20m

* ADR1399H behavioral macromodel
* Pins: cathode anode heater+ heater-
.subckt ADR1399H K A HP HM
VREF_INT NZ A 7.05
RZ NZ K 0.5
CREF K A 10n
RHEATER HP HM 1.5k
.ends ADR1399H

* LTC6078 dual-op-amp behavioral macromodel
* Pins: OUTA INA- INA+ V- INB+ INB- OUTB V+
.subckt LTC6078 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8
XAMP_A 3 2 8 4 1 LTC6078_AMP
XAMP_B 5 6 8 4 7 LTC6078_AMP
.ends LTC6078

* Single amplifier section
* Pins: noninverting inverting V+ V- output
.subckt LTC6078_AMP NP NM VP VN VO
RIN NP NM 1T
BOPEN NDRV 0 V=limit(1e6*V(NP,NM),V(VN)+20m,V(VP)-20m)
ROUT NDRV VO 2
COUT VO 0 5p
.ends LTC6078_AMP

.end
